1445:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style_gen.h **** 
1446:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style_gen.h **** /**
1447:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * First draw Widget on the layer, then scale down layer opacity factor. Value 0,
1448:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * `LV_OPA_0` or `LV_OPA_TRANSP` means fully transparent, 255, `LV_OPA_100` or
